<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Input — Session & Cookie demo</title>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Enter author and page color</h1>
  <form method="GET" action="/session/process">
    <label>Author (name): <input type="text" name="author" required></label><br><br>
    <label>Page color:
      <select name="color">
        <option value="white">White</option>
        <option value="#f8e6e6">Light Red</option>
        <option value="#e6f8e6">Light Green</option>
        <option value="#e6e9f8">Light Blue</option>
      </select>
    </label><br><br>
    <button type="submit">Submit</button>
  </form>
  <p>Note: author will be saved in a cookie (book.author) and also in server session. Session id stored in HttpOnly cookie SID.</p>
</body>
</html>
